#==== chunks
#---- prose_and_fences_stay_and_chunks_format
# Report

Some *prose* with  two spaces, and `r 1+1` inline.

```{r setup, echo=FALSE}
x<-c(1,2)
```

More prose.

```{r}
f<-function(a){a+1}
```
#++++
# Report

Some *prose* with  two spaces, and `r 1+1` inline.

```{r setup, echo=FALSE}
x <- c(1, 2)
```

More prose.

```{r}
f <- function(a) { a + 1 }
```

